      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229270/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place noodles in a large bowl; cover with hot water. Stir; soak until softened, about 15 minutes. Drain; rinse thoroughly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0vzBqsHeNvuXulb6NTnCA0rEGd0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229270-spicy-rice-noodle-salad-VAT-step-02-2b8917516c7b4bb399ac52a7d54c2e7b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229270/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine vinegar, fish sauce, garlic, chili paste, brown sugar and salt in a bowl. Add 4 green onions, carrots, basil, mint, and cilantro.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dbg9PCLkLGVm7vLV2gA_OUhV9B8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229270-spicy-rice-noodle-salad-VAT-step-03-d347e9ea80cd4ab3acc7aa0d29111fb7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229270/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in noodles, ½ cup peanuts, and sesame oil; toss to coat. Set aside for flavors to absorb, 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NEW-h4x-NKwi7mBayWSrawQSduM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/229270-spicy-rice-noodle-salad-VAT-step-04-4e0e8d10f8ff4be2a5f0da786d5513a2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229270/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top servings with grilled chicken and Fresno chiles; garnish with green onions and peanuts.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
